# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# vex-graph/worktree — root superbuild + agent docs repository.
#
# This root repo tracks ONLY the workspace scaffolding and documentation.
# Every directory below is an *independent* git checkout with its own remote.
# They are ignored here on purpose so this repo never duplicates their content.
# Commit and push inside each of those checkouts — never here.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Nested independent repositories
personal/b/
ecosystem/
personal/
projects/
tests/
_notes/
_main/
_trash/
metadata/vexgraph-ecosystem-gitrepo/

# Build output
cmake-build-*/
build/
*.o
*.a
*.dylib
*.dSYM/

# IDE / editor
.idea/
.vscode/

# OS / misc
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# b build state + generated artefacts
.b/
personal/b/b.json
personal/b/compile_commands.json
/b.json
run/hello

# Private assets — never published
resources/

# harnesses (i only use oc as of rn)
.opencode/
.claude/
.codex/
.antigravity/

# Local constitution; published separately as a GitHub Gist (monolith + split tree).
/PREFERENCES.md
# directories that go r1-r6
suite/
metadata/

# metadata/gists/preferences/ is the hand-maintained working view of the constitution.
# Track only its small human/agent-facing files.
# (Negations must come after the `metadata/` ignore rule above to take effect.)
!metadata/
!metadata/gists/
!metadata/gists/preferences/
!metadata/gists/preferences/.gitignore
!metadata/gists/preferences/_introduction.md
!metadata/gists/preferences/gist.md
!metadata/gists/preferences/README.md
!metadata/gists/preferences/overview-template.c
!metadata/gists/preferences/main-template.c
